Phase 3 — the first patch that can move the money KPIs.

- lib/energy/customers.ts: one anonymised record per conversation
  (segment, region, size band, cost band, budget-owner ROLE, stage).
  Names stay in the private CRM (ref). The wedge-A funnel and the
  qualified / pilots KPIs are DERIVED from these records — nothing is
  typed by hand (D-011). Stages that count: conversation, cost-named,
  data-shared, paid-trial. contacted and declined do not.
- /energy/customers (EN/DE) + /api/energy/customers.
- components/EnergyIntakeForm.tsx + cluster=energy branch in /api/intake:
  the five discovery questions, same webhook, tagged, no files; works
  without JS (303 → /energy/customers#received|#error). Live on /,
  /energy/wedge, /energy/customers (D-012). SKU intake kept on / below it.
- scripts/ceo-report.mjs (Node, zero deps) reads /api/energy/* and writes
  the ten mandated sections to docs/energy/reports/YYYY-MM-DD.md;
  .github/workflows/ceo-report.yml runs it every Friday and opens a PR
  (D-013). Week-0 baseline report committed.
- docs/energy/wedge-a/: OFFER.md (four-week dispatch review, price
  hypothesis band, kill condition), DISCOVERY_SCRIPT.de.md (20-minute
  call, the five questions, stage mapping), TARGET_LIST.md (how the
  first fifty CRM rows are built from MaStR / BNetzA / VKU; no names in
  the repo).
- AGENTS.md: customer-evidence rules. MIGRATION.md: phase 3 record.

Verified: tsc clean; next build prerenders 121 pages; /api/intake
energy path returns 503 intake_unconfigured without the webhook (never
a fake success), 400 on missing fields, 303 to /de/energy/customers
without JS; report script produces all ten sections from a local server.

